  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f08c681e718a1c42",
      "translationZh": "我们已经发布了采用 GSQ 和 RCO 量化的 Qwen3.8-Flash-Next，同时还发布了第二个以能力为目标的构建版本，其中该模型一半的专家已被移除。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6272456479de2a74",
      "translationZh": "Flash-Next 是一种稀疏混合专家模型：每层拥有 512 个路由专家，共 48 层，参数量为 176.9 B，使用 BF16 时占用 354 GB。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "0d51d3b152470319",
      "translationZh": "四个量化 GGUFs , 2.40 到 3.50 bpw (66.4 到 83.6 GB)，以及 BF16 视觉投影仪",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "31b747014d26240b",
      "translationZh": "专家修剪的 Coder GGUF ，总计 58.4 GB，其中 29.6 GB 必须保持驻留",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "59ae6d727c81ffbc",
      "translationZh": "GSQ (Gumbel-Softmax Quantization)：post-training scalar quantization，共同学习 grid assignments 和 group scales，在低 bit-widths 下缩小 scalar and vector quantization 之间的大部分差距，同时仍可在 standard GGUF types 中部署。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "fa59d8239779755d",
      "translationZh": "RCO（黎曼约束优化）：通过在任务损失上进行梯度下降来强制执行精确预算，无需每个约束进行调校。它在此版本中承担两个角色：为每个张量分配量化类型，以及在 Coder 构建中选择保留哪些专家，在此过程中它同时强制执行多个精确预算，每层一个。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "66cdc954da4b59a9",
      "translationZh": "在 3.50 bpw 时，该模型在所有评估的基准测试中与 BF16 基准相匹配。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "c3091be8377bbc8d",
      "translationZh": "IQ3_S (3.50 bpw, 83.6 GB) : AIME25 100.00, GPQA-Diamond 92.93 对比 BF16 的 91.92 , LiveCodeBench v6 86.86 对比 87.43. 任务平均 93.26 对比 93.12。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "e91b97f7fadef08d",
      "translationZh": "Q2_0 (2.40 bpw, 66.4 GB) : 零样本平均 78.00，高于 BF16 值 76.94，大约是原始大小的五分之一",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "81ee6bd3c319d976",
      "translationZh": "Coder（能力裁剪模型）：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3d519c30aa434dd1",
      "translationZh": "与其在较低精度下存储每个参数，模型中一半的路由专家被移除：每层 512 中的 256，由 RCO 通过优化与未裁剪模型的 KL 散度来选择。保留的权重仍保持在 3.5 bpw。裁剪和量化的效果叠加，合并后的效果是原始 Transformer 每个参数平均 1.89 位。平均位宽将移除的专家摊薄到原始参数数量上，从而表达了裁剪和量化的联合效应。没有单独的权重存储为 1.89 位。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b30a642e07a76c64",
      "translationZh": "实际后果是，一个 176.9B 参数模型的常驻工作集为 29.6 GB，因为 n-gram 分片是一个查找表，可以从磁盘提供。这在单个 32 GB 加速器的容量范围内。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "8ae21ffca308e0be",
      "translationZh": "SWE-bench Verified：75.60 对比 BF16 的 82.80，保留 91.3%",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "6e7a9214c651cd3e",
      "translationZh": "LiveCodeBench v6：86.28 对比 87.43，保留 98.7%",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "84d7a4c990cbb759",
      "translationZh": "两者均在 xhigh 推理强度下测量。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "list-item",
