      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "32d044dc11e6faf4",
      "translationZh": "两个仓库均提供完整的按张量 RCO 分配。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "25ce2ae5771129d4",
      "translationZh": "Coder 构建是一个实验性发布，欢迎反馈，特别是对校准混合中未体现的功能。欢迎提出对模型进行量化或剪枝的请求。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "paragraph",
